{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n35歲「前東張女神」阮嘉敏參加《女神配對計劃2》，令她昔日參選港姐的泳裝問答片段再度翻Hit。當年面對6Wing取笑「男友」C君身高，她即霸氣護航兼越講越激動，真性情反應令司儀急急截停，場面爆笑！\n</p>\n<h2>阮嘉敏港姐台上應變力受考驗</h2>\n<p>在這場備受矚目《香港小姐》泳裝問答環節中，穿著熱帶風掛頸式比堅尼上陣阮嘉敏被安排與C君進行情境對話。當她溫柔地向對方表示拍拖八年希望對方能夠更加上進時，在旁6永突然發難將話題強行轉移至男方身高缺陷上。6永當眾爆出一句「叫佢收入唔高個人都高返啲呀」，全場即刻爆笑。</p>\n<h2>阮嘉敏越講越激動 主持急急截停</h2>\n<p>阮嘉敏開聲護航，她毫不猶豫地當面反擊6Wing，語氣堅定地直斥「你唔可以咁話我BB」，及後她更再三向主持強調絕對不會嫌棄對方外表，越講越激動，語氣非常「巴渣」，最終一眾大會司儀見狀急急中途截停話題打圓場。</p>\n<h2>告別東張西望轉型演員事業起飛</h2>\n<p>回看這位高學歷才女演藝發展之路，自當年晉身十強後便加入電視台默默耕耘十年。她早年憑藉《東張西望》主持身分廣為觀眾熟悉，及後為追尋演員夢毅然跳出舒適圈，參演《靈戲逼人》及《新聞女王2》等重頭劇集。近期她更積極開拓內地龐大市場，首度擔正主演微短劇《瘦一斤，賺一斤，虐哭前任不過癮》火速突破30,000,000驚人播放量，交出極具說服力亮眼成績單。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚中大傳理才女高超情商</h2>\n<p>這段充滿戲劇性經典重溫片段近日再次於各大網上討論區瘋傳，大批網民紛紛留言力撐女方當年應對表現極具大將之風。不少觀眾留言大讚「真正展現高學歷才女應有風度」，指出她不僅沒有被現場失控氣氛嚇退，反而能夠冷靜應對突發狀況。同時有粉絲被其敢言性格深深吸引，直指「肯出聲護航真係無得頂」，表示該片段完美紀錄下其真實不造作臨場反應。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987990454165200_5508533446aaf6660d914b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 35歲「前東張女神」阮嘉敏參加《女神配對計劃2》，令她昔日參選港姐的泳裝問答片段再度翻Hit（圖片來源：TVB）（圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987990454165200_5508533446aaf6660d914b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>35歲「前東張女神」阮嘉敏參加《女神配對計劃2》，令她昔日參選港姐的泳裝問答片段再度翻Hit（圖片來源：TVB）<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987992046678243_18767739416aaf667101724.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 （圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987992046678243_18767739416aaf667101724.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>（圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987990579196062_11659593576aaf6662a4efc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 阮嘉敏穿比堅尼挑戰情境題（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987990579196062_11659593576aaf6662a4efc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>阮嘉敏穿比堅尼挑戰情境題（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987990923190792_7883408696aaf666608e74.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 阮嘉敏指唔介意「男友」收入唔高（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987990923190792_7883408696aaf666608e74.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>阮嘉敏指唔介意「男友」收入唔高（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987991318155409_10820216436aaf6669ad675.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 阮嘉敏當年為「男友」C君霸氣護航（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987991318155409_10820216436aaf6669ad675.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>阮嘉敏當年為「男友」C君霸氣護航（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17898799154633348_8103800056aaf666bcbac9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 6Wing當眾寸C君身高（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17898799154633348_8103800056aaf666bcbac9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>6Wing當眾寸C君身高（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987991745224965_6261711306aaf666e1670c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 阮嘉敏港姐台上越講越激動（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987991745224965_6261711306aaf666e1670c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>阮嘉敏港姐台上越講越激動（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987992357798259_1984428516aaf6673dd72b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 （圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987992357798259_1984428516aaf6673dd72b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987992545929491_20585612246aaf6675c15e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 （圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987992545929491_20585612246aaf6675c15e7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987992697790188_7324975166aaf6677a9523.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 （圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987992697790188_7324975166aaf6677a9523.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17898799288842111_8046886346aaf667945512.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"阮嘉敏 香港小姐 （圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17898799288842111_8046886346aaf667945512.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:41:24.084388+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1218,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:19:08.360555+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T03:38:28.346227+00:00","content_hash":"60cede52ab96799c4c0dfe84a94b942168efec4ca700851f4fffc533a87c5b57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}